WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.050
Fictional Meridian teaching case. No course example grants workplace authority . Requests and unverified claims are not approvals. Daniel can edit a supplier record, but finance has not authorised the requested bank-detail change. Which check is missing, and what should he do next? Competence Can I perform this work to the required standard? Knowing how to edit supplier records is not authority to approve a bank-detail change. Refer the verification and decision to the appointed finance owner.
